      {
        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "The plaintiff Carmen Castro Flores (hereinafter the injured plaintiff) allegedly was injured when she slipped and fell on hay, straw, or dried, cut grass, while walking on the grass in an apple orchard owned by the defendant.",
        "statement_status": "allegation"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Here, the defendant established its prima facie entitlement to judgment as a matter of law by demonstrating that the condition of the grass was open and obvious and not inherently dangerous, as well as incidental to the nature of an apple orchard and reasonably to be anticipated by those using it",
