      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E005",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Contrary to the plaintiffs' further contention, \"[t]he fact that [the] defendant's [*2] supporting proof was placed before the court by way of an attorney's affirmation annexing deposition testimony and other proof, rather than affidavits of fact on personal knowledge, is not fatal to the motion",
